  - non-extinction architecture
abstract: >-
  World v6.2 is a ratification-candidate architecture that separates canonical
  identity, truth, policy, authority, effects, cognition, and evolution. It uses
  a deterministic model-independent mother core with replaceable AI brains,
  bounded fractal decomposition, resolution-aware context projection, councils,
  shadow evaluation, staged compilation, and explicit evidence and rollback
  gates. Version 6.2.0-rc.3 is non-canonical, not deployed, and claims E2 local
  component/contract evidence only. Original software is made available for
  noncommercial purposes under PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 and original
  documentation/architecture under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, as mapped in LICENSE.
